  "id": "creamy-bacon-rigatoni",
  "name": "Creamy Bacon Rigatoni",
  "subtitle": "Rigatoni in a smooth cheese sauce with bacon, ham, and peas",
  "description": "Tender rigatoni is combined with a creamy Parmesan sauce, crisp bacon, diced ham, and green peas for a hearty American-style main dish.",
